          %p
          #ExampleSketchUnitalMagmas.num_remark
            %h6 Example
            %p
              A sketch, more precisely a finite product sketch, for the theory of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unital+magmas"} unital magmas
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sets"} sets
              equipped with a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/binary+operation"} binary operation
              which has a two sided
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/neutral+element"} neutral element
            %p The directed graph can be taken to be the following:
            %div{:style => "text-align: center"}
              %svg{:height => "175.748", :viewbox => "0 0 175.748 175.748", :width => "175.748", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", "xmlns:xlink" => "http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"}
                %defs
                  %g
